                                                "sense_id": "3e4a3bc0-47e2-3493-8cfe-5027faf2686a",
                                                "text": "The walls were entirely hidden by bookshelves, or by cases containing rare specimens of fossil bones and reptile skeletons. Here was a grizzly crocodile, its teeth white and sharp as when they glistened in the waters of the Nile;..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "986b08d0-04ea-4155-82b5-15baa7565cd0",
                                                "sense_id": "3e4a3bc0-47e2-3493-8cfe-5027faf2686a",
                                                "text": "This after Taliban militants led a grizzly campaign of attacks, including beheadings, kidnappings and the destruction of dozens of girls' schools."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
